        <h2 id="collect">1. Information we collect</h2>

        <h3>Information you give us</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Email address</strong>, when you subscribe to a newsletter or create a Nerra account. Subscribing is explicit and opt-in.</li>
            <li><strong>Membership details</strong>, if you join Nerra Personal: the shows you pick, their order, and, for the morning-brief tier, the city you choose. We keep this so we can build your feed.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment</strong> is handled entirely by Stripe. We receive a confirmation that a subscription is active; we never see or store your card number.</li>
            <li><strong>Messages you send us</strong> (name, email, and what you wrote) when you contact us.</li>
            <li><strong>Guest applications and interviews</strong> on The Age of AI and Nerra Voices &mdash; see <a href="#guests">If you are a guest</a> below.</li>
        </ul>

        {#- Oct 7 2026: the interview shows collect more than anything else on
